  "description": "Multi-issuer JWT/OIDC token validator for .NET 6.0, 7.0, 8.0, and 9.0. Supports Azure AD, Auth0, AWS Cognito, Google, and custom JWT issuers. Features one-liner Auth0 setup with UseAuth0(), machine-to-machine token support, and development diagnostics. Includes ASP.NET Core middleware and authorization extensions.",
